comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T02:35:07.399Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: all-status searches for test result tracking, structured measurements, numeric metrics, quality metrics, and test_runs found the shipped pm-lm0j/pm-16f4/pm-i2pc persistence lineage but no item owning typed numeric evidence, series retention, metric filters, or diffs. GH-802 is therefore a new extension of that canonical lineage: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/802."
  "2026-07-29T05:55:21.797Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence: typed bounded run measurements now span storage normalization, public types, SDK parse/query/diff functions, CLI repeatable flags, background forwarding, MCP/tool schemas, contracts, docs, and run-attributed read results. Isolated packed npm+npx and Bun+bunx consumers passed, including public SDK imports and a real persisted coverage/latency run. Full suite: 6506 tests; 100% statements/branches/functions/lines."
